WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.830
Meet two sisters.

2
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:02.750
Same mum.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.790
Same dad.

4
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.690
So you might expect them
to look exactly the same.

5
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.990
But they don't.

6
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.010
Different hair.

7
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.050
Different eyes.

8
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.310
Different heights.

9
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.930
If they have the same two parents,
why aren't they the same?

10
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.950
In this mission, we'll zoom inside
a cell, to the chromosomes,

11
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.830
DNA and genes.

12
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.670
You'll see the X-ray picture
that helped reveal the shape of

13
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.490
DNA.

14
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.470
And you'll learn how to measure
the differences between people,

15
00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.250
and how to show them on a graph.

16
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.260
Your mission: explain why brothers
and sisters aren't the same.
